---
description: Bubble Tea v2 TUI patterns for anoted
globs: internal/tui/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Use Bubble Tea v2 (`charm.land/bubbletea/v2`) with the Model-Update-View pattern.

- `View()` returns `tea.View`, not `string`. Set `AltScreen`, `WindowTitle`, etc. on the view.
- Handle `tea.KeyPressMsg` (not v1 `tea.KeyMsg` struct).
- Never block the Update loop; use `tea.Cmd` for async work (polling, recording, detection).
- Keep model state serializable where possible.
- Split UI into `internal/tui/components/` for reusable pieces.
- TUI must not import platform-specific packages directly; use injected interfaces.
